#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""AGY weekly quota reset detector and minimal chat-only wakeup tool.

Checks `agy --output-format json -p=/usage` (zero token usage, no conversation
created). Only when a weekly quota bucket (`gemini-weekly` or `3p-weekly`) is
sitting at 100% unactivated (its 7-day reset clock has not started ticking yet)
does it send a single minimal chat-only prompt (`tools: []`, no rules/skills/MCP,
no permission-skipping or OS sandbox flags) from an empty temporary directory to
wake up the 7-day countdown immediately. If a future AGY CLI release changes
custom-agent frontmatter or optional flags, it automatically falls back to a
plain non-yolo `agy --model ... -p=...` request.

Compatible with Python 3.8+ (macOS & Linux including Ubuntu 22.04 / WSL2).
"""

